sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as OGX Operator<br/>controller-runtime
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGXPod as OGX Server Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 1: OGXServer Instance Deployment
        User->>K8sAPI: 1. Create OGXServer CR<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS | User creds
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: 2. Validate CR<br/>HTTPS/9443 | TLS (service-serving-cert)<br/>API server client cert
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result (Fail-closed)
        K8sAPI-->>User: CR accepted/rejected

        Note over Operator: Reconciliation triggered
        Operator->>K8sAPI: 3. Read CR, Secrets, ConfigMaps<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS | SA token
        Operator->>OCI: 4. Fetch distribution image labels<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS | Registry creds
        OCI-->>Operator: Image manifest with OGX config defaults

        Note over Operator: Generate config.yaml<br/>Render kustomize manifests<br/>Create content-addressable ConfigMap
        Operator->>K8sAPI: 5. Server-Side Apply resources<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS | SA token
        Note over K8sAPI: Creates: Deployment, Service,<br/>PVC, NetworkPolicy, PDB,<br/>HPA, ServiceMonitor, etc.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 2: OGXServer Status Polling
        loop Every reconciliation
            Operator->>OGXPod: 1. GET /v1/providers, /v1/version<br/>HTTP/8000 | Plaintext | No auth<br/>(5s timeout)
            OGXPod-->>Operator: Provider list & version info
            Operator->>K8sAPI: 2. Update OGXServer status<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS | SA token
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 3: Legacy Resource Adoption (LlamaStack → OGX)
        User->>K8sAPI: 1. Create OGXServer CR with annotations<br/>ogx.io/adopt-storage, ogx.io/adopt-networking
        Operator->>K8sAPI: 2. Scale legacy Deployment to 0<br/>Wait for pod termination
        Operator->>K8sAPI: 3. PVC: detach ownerRef, relabel
        Operator->>K8sAPI: 4. Service/Ingress: transfer ownership,<br/>update selectors
        Note over Operator: Sentinel errors for<br/>controlled requeue during<br/>pod termination wait
    end
